2. Material of third parties in the thesis

The thesis is published under CC BY 4.0. That licence covers what the author
created. It does not cover the material of third parties in the thesis: this
repository does not license it, and all rights remain with the holders named
below or in the list of figures of the thesis (pp. 65-67). The same applies to
the reading copy under publication/.

Marks. Every page of the thesis carries the mark of TH Köln and the mark of
Jamestown US-Immobilien GmbH, the partner company named in the thesis, in its
header, and so does every page of the colloquium handout under slides/. Both
marks are excepted.

The colloquium handout. Besides the two marks, the table on its page 1 is
excepted: the handout's source [2] names it as taken from i.redd.it
(1 July 2021), "How long will it take to crack your password?".

