3. Notices of 2021 in the thesis

The thesis prints a restriction notice (p. 2) and a blocking notice (p. 71)
that restricted access to it until 2024-06-30. The restriction has ended; the
thesis was published open access on 2026-09-14. The deposited file keeps both
notices as they were printed.


4. Declared edits

publication/Torun_Password_Keyless_Authentication.pdf
  None. The file is byte-identical with the file the catalogue record serves.

publication/Torun_Password_Keyless_Authentication_reading-copy.pdf
  The deposited file with its images downsampled by Ghostscript, and with the
  document subject set to say that it is a reading copy.
  publication/README.md gives the command.

docs/figures/thesis-figure-32.png to thesis-figure-36.png
  The image objects 127, 132, 135, 138 and 141 on pages 42 and 44 to 47 of
  the deposited file, written as PNG by pdfimages (poppler) without other
  change.

slides/colloquium-handout-2021-07-05.de.pdf
  The author's copy of the handout. The matriculation number that followed
  his name on page 1 is removed.

src/cMD5.cs, src/cRSA.cs, src/Raven One.cs
  The author's 2021 source files, stored with LF line endings and without a
  byte order mark. At the tag epub-3598 their header comments are as the
  deposited thesis prints them: the header line that held the author's
  matriculation number in 2021 is blank there, and is blank here. Since the
  relicensing, the GPL notice at the end of each header is replaced by SPDX
  tags and a note on the licence history; the header lines above them are
  still as printed, and the code below the header is unchanged.


